| Norgate Data Products
 Pros
 Cons
 PricePrice range: $$ (1k-5k) For detailed pricing information, refer to https://norgatedata.com/prices.php Our ExperienceNorgate Data is widely considered the “gold standard” for systematic traders who value data accuracy over speed. In our experience, the setup process via the Norgate Data Updater is robust, though it requires a bit of local disk space since the database is stored on your machine. The biggest advantage is the historical index constituent data—knowing exactly which stocks were in the S&P 500 in 1995 is a game-changer for professional-grade strategy development. It is a specialized tool that does one thing exceptionally well: providing the cleanest possible “End-of-Day” data for serious research. |